flowchart TB
    Internet((Internet))
    CF[CloudFront]
    subgraph VPC[Logical VPC boundary - actual layout unknown]
        ALB[ALB]
        subgraph Tasks[ECS task networking - subnet and AZ unknown]
            Gateway[Gateway task]
            Services[Backend service tasks]
        end
        Redis[(Redis endpoint)]
    end
    DB[(MongoDB endpoint)]
    APIs[External APIs]
    Internet --> CF --> ALB --> Gateway --> Services
    Gateway --> Redis
    Services --> Redis
    Services --> DB
    Services --> APIs
    Routes[Route tables define network paths]
    SG[Security groups filter resource traffic]
    Routes -. governs .-> VPC
    SG -. applies to .-> ALB
    SG -. applies to .-> Tasks
    SG -. applies to .-> Redis
